  "listing": {
    "state": "hidden",
    "since": "2026-07-17",
    "reason": "Dark launch: the tile streams fine, but the phone-dock archetype it renders as is not finished, so it is not announced in the grid or the hall yet. Carried over from the hardcoded HIDDEN_IDS set in spa/src/data/useManifest.ts, whose date is when the android exhibit was last verified. Delete this block when the phone dock ships."
